.TH mine_detector 1 "2013-07-03" "Mine Detector" "Mine Detector"
.SH NAME
\fBmine_detector\fP - a mine-finding game
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mine Detector is a mine-finding game with somewhat different rules from other
mine-finding games. Mine Detector rarely requires guessing. Only at the higher
levels may guessing sometimes be the only way to win.
.PP
For instructions on how to play, start the game and click the Rules button.
.SH AUTHORS
Mine Detector was written by Jeffrey Carter.
.PP
This manual page was written by Björn Persson <Bjorn@Rombobjörn.se>.
